# Icon SVGs under /assets/icons/ are COMMITTED deliberately — do not add them
# here. A self-hosted instance must render its UI without reaching
# api.iconify.design, and the production image is built from this tree, so the
# icons have to be in it. Re-ignoring them silently returns the product to
# fetching its own icons over the network at render time.
# Refresh with `bin/console ux:icons:lock`; icons whose name is built
# dynamically in a template need an explicit `ux:icons:import` (see CLAUDE.md).

