# Internal working notes. NEXT_STEPS is committed (see CLAUDE.md), because a
# tracker only one checkout can see is a tracker the next session cannot read.
# AUTOMATIONS stays local: it is a scratchpad of enforcement ideas, not shared
# open work.
#
# Both must be dealt with before this repository is published — NEXT_STEPS is in
# git history by then, so removing it from HEAD is not enough.
/docs/AUTOMATIONS.md

# Skeleton sync state. Local to whoever bootstrapped this checkout (it records
# an absolute path on their machine), so it is kept out of the public repo.
/.skeleton.json

# Go CLI build output
/cli/dist/
